@startuml
title ZENIT - Secuencia modulo NOK Camaras

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Operador
participant "Frontend React\nNokCamarasPage" as FE
participant "API FastAPI\n/cameras/nok/overview" as API
participant "Servicio Monitoreo Red\n_refresh_camera_network_snapshot" as Monitor
database "camera_video" as CameraVideo
database "camera_network_status_current" as CurrentStatus
database "camera_network_status_log" as StatusLog
participant "Camara IP / NVR" as Camera
participant "Configuracion\n/ cameras / sources" as Config

== Apertura del modulo NOK ==
Operador -> FE : Abrir /cameras/nok
FE -> API : GET overview
API -> CameraVideo : SELECT camaras con nok_enabled = true
CameraVideo --> API : Inventario NOK + x_pct/y_pct
API -> CurrentStatus : SELECT estado actual por camera_id
CurrentStatus --> API : status cached

alt Estado vencido o force=true
  API -> Monitor : refrescar snapshot NOK
  loop por cada camara NOK
    Monitor -> Camera : ICMP ping
    alt ping no responde
      Monitor -> Camera : TCP probe puerto RTSP/HTTP
    end
    Monitor -> StatusLog : INSERT historico\n(status, is_online, checked_at,\nresponse_ms, error_detail, check_method)
    Monitor -> CurrentStatus : UPSERT estado actual\n(last_online_at, last_offline_at,\noffline_since, checked_at)
  end
end

API -> CameraVideo : leer metadata final NOK
CameraVideo --> API : nombre, mapa, x_pct, y_pct,\nnok_map_number, nok_display_name
API --> FE : JSON overview\n(summary + maps + cameras)
FE --> Operador : Grilla 2x2, popups NOK,\ntabla offline y fullscreen

== Edicion desde Configuracion ==
Operador -> Config : Editar camara
Config -> CameraVideo : UPDATE x_pct, y_pct,\nnok_enabled, nok_map_number,\nnok_display_name
CameraVideo --> Config : cambios persistidos
Config --> Operador : Confirmacion guardado

Operador -> FE : Reabrir / refrescar NOK Camaras
FE -> API : GET overview
API -> CameraVideo : SELECT coordenadas y metadata
CameraVideo --> API : posicion actualizada
API --> FE : mismo dato de BD
FE --> Operador : Waypoint NOK en nueva ubicacion

@enduml
